# The print repeats both parts: ":||:" before "Kann i" and ":||" at the very end (scan n91, crops at about
# x 930-1620 y 1150-1460 and x 2240-2740 y 2700-3020 of the 2800 px page). So both are written out twice, A A B B,
# and the second part is led in again by "Kann i" (E4 G#4). The first part is the same both times; only the words differ.
id muss-i-denn
de Muss i denn zum Städtele hinaus
en Muss i denn zum Städtele hinaus
aliases muss i denn;muss i denn muss i denn zum staedtele hinaus;muss i denn zum staedtele naus
